1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,295
Welcome back!

2
00:00:01,295 --> 00:00:04,107
In this lesson, you'll
set up the chat widget,

3
00:00:04,107 --> 00:00:08,999
the little bubble in the corner of your
website that turns curious visitors into

4
00:00:08,999 --> 00:00:10,161
real conversations.

5
00:00:10,161 --> 00:00:12,606
We'll style it, test it, and install it.

6
00:00:13,491 --> 00:00:16,325
You'll find it under
Sites, then Chat Widget.

7
00:00:16,325 --> 00:00:20,041
Here's why it matters: most
people won't pick up the phone,

8
00:00:20,041 --> 00:00:22,308
but they will type a quick question.

9
00:00:22,308 --> 00:00:27,535
Every chat becomes a contact in your CRM,
and the conversation lands in your inbox.

10
00:00:28,385 --> 00:00:29,552
Open your widget.

11
00:00:29,552 --> 00:00:31,473
First, choose the chat type.

12
00:00:31,473 --> 00:00:35,934
Live Chat keeps the conversation
inside the widget, in real time.

13
00:00:35,934 --> 00:00:41,219
SMS and Email collects the visitor's
details, and you reply by text or email,

14
00:00:41,219 --> 00:00:45,336
so the conversation follows
them after they leave your site.

15
00:00:46,187 --> 00:00:47,663
Next, style and colours.

16
00:00:47,663 --> 00:00:50,369
Pick a theme colour
that matches your brand,

17
00:00:50,369 --> 00:00:53,013
and choose which corner
the bubble sits in.

18
00:00:53,013 --> 00:00:55,350
Then give the bubble a friendly label.

19
00:00:55,350 --> 00:01:00,024
Something like questions, chat with us,
works much better than a plain icon.

20
00:01:00,024 --> 00:01:02,976
The live preview on the
right updates as you go.

21
00:01:03,824 --> 00:01:08,100
In Chat window, write the greeting
people see when they open the chat.

22
00:01:08,100 --> 00:01:12,987
Keep it warm and specific to your business,
and tell them how quickly you reply.

23
00:01:12,987 --> 00:01:16,652
You can also show a small pop-up
prompt after a few seconds,

24
00:01:16,652 --> 00:01:18,790
to start the conversation for them.

25
00:01:19,617 --> 00:01:23,768
Under Contact form, choose what
visitors fill in before they chat.

26
00:01:23,768 --> 00:01:26,598
Name, phone and a message
are usually enough.

27
00:01:26,598 --> 00:01:29,366
Every extra field means
fewer people finish.

28
00:01:29,366 --> 00:01:33,895
Leave the consent text switched on,
so you're allowed to text them back.

29
00:01:34,746 --> 00:01:38,900
On Growth and Pro, you can let
Conversation AI answer first.

30
00:01:38,900 --> 00:01:44,233
It replies instantly, even at midnight,
using what you teach it in AI Agents,

31
00:01:44,233 --> 00:01:46,241
then hands over to your team.

32
00:01:47,092 --> 00:01:48,870
Finally, the acknowledgement.

33
00:01:48,870 --> 00:01:52,364
This message appears straight
after someone sends a chat,

34
00:01:52,364 --> 00:01:56,717
so they know a real person has it
and roughly when to expect an answer.

35
00:01:57,567 --> 00:02:00,273
Now test it, exactly like a visitor would.

36
00:02:00,273 --> 00:02:03,559
Fill in the form in the
preview and send a message.

37
00:02:03,559 --> 00:02:06,459
You'll see the
acknowledgement, the AI reply,

38
00:02:06,459 --> 00:02:09,101
and a new chat arriving in Conversations.

39
00:02:09,918 --> 00:02:10,830
Happy with it?

40
00:02:10,830 --> 00:02:12,524
Click Save, then Get Code.

41
00:02:12,524 --> 00:02:14,087
Copy this short snippet.

42
00:02:14,087 --> 00:02:18,190
It's the same code for every
page, so you only install it once.

43
00:02:19,047 --> 00:02:24,280
On WordPress, Wix or Squarespace, paste
it into the footer or custom code setting,

44
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:26,386
just before the closing body tag.

45
00:02:26,386 --> 00:02:27,279
Not technical?

46
00:02:27,279 --> 00:02:29,832
Email it straight to your web developer.

47
00:02:29,832 --> 00:02:33,852
And on Kyntlo funnels and websites,
you don't need code at all.

48
00:02:34,703 --> 00:02:37,306
Just open your funnel or website settings,

49
00:02:37,306 --> 00:02:40,591
pick your widget from the
Chat widget menu, and save.

50
00:02:40,591 --> 00:02:43,381
It then appears on every
page of that funnel.

51
00:02:44,230 --> 00:02:45,350
Here's a pro tip.

52
00:02:45,350 --> 00:02:46,075
Speed wins.

53
00:02:46,075 --> 00:02:50,686
Leads who get a reply within five
minutes are far more likely to book,

54
00:02:50,686 --> 00:02:56,023
so turn on new-message notifications and
answer new chats the moment they arrive.

55
00:02:56,873 --> 00:02:59,579
Your website is now
open for conversations!

56
00:02:59,579 --> 00:03:03,480
Next, we'll set up calls, voicemail
and missed-call text-back,

57
00:03:03,480 --> 00:03:05,871
so no caller slips through the cracks.

58
00:03:05,871 --> 00:03:06,752
See you there.
